#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Ntabwo ufite uburenganzira ku gikoresho cy'iryo huriro."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Izina: irindi huriro risanzwe rikoresha iri zina."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Ihuriro ntiryabitswe: ryahinduwe n'undi muntu kuva ifishi ifunguwe, cyangwa kwandika byananiranye. Ongera urifungure maze usubiremo impinduka."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Ihuriro ryabitswe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Imiterere y'ihuriro ntiyahinduwe: kwandika byananiranye. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Ihuriro n'ishusho yaryo y'ako kanya yari ibitswe byasibwe. Igikoresho cyaryo n'ibishushanyo byaryo byagumishijweho. Umugenga w'imirimo ntiyavugishijwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Igikoresho n'ibishushanyo byacyo byaremwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Igikoresho nticyaremwe: ihuriro risanzwe rifite igikoresho, ryahinduwe n'undi muntu kuva urupapuro rufunguwe, cyangwa Cacti yarabyanze. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Ihuriro ryahujwe n'igikoresho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Ihuriro ntiryahujwe: igikoresho ntikibaho, ntucyemerewe, gisanzwe gifite irindi huriro, cyangwa ihuriro ryahinduwe n'undi muntu kuva urupapuro rufunguwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Ibishushanyo byaburaga byongeweho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Nta bishushanyo byongeweho: ihuriro nta gikoresho rifite, cyangwa igikoresho cyaryo ntikikibaho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Ihuriro ntiryatandukanyijwe: ryahinduwe n'undi muntu kuva urupapuro rufunguwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Ihuriro ryatandukanyijwe. Igikoresho n'ibishushanyo byacyo byagumishijweho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Ibice byongeye kubarwa bivuye ku ishusho y'ako kanya."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Ibice ntibyongeye kubarwa: igikoresho cyarahagaritswe cyangwa kitagerwaho, bityo Cacti yasimbuste ishakisha ryacyo ry'amakuru."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ibice ntibyongeye kubarwa: Cacti ntiyashoboye gukora ishakisha ry'amakuru. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Ibice ntibyongeye kubarwa: ishakisha ry'amakuru rya HPC Scheduler ntiryashyizwemo. Shyiramo ibyitegererezo uvuye ku rupapuro rw'ubuzima bwa sisitemu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Ibice ntibyongeye kubarwa: ihuriro nta gikoresho rifite, cyangwa igikoresho cyaryo ntikikibaho."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Ibyitegererezo bya HPC Scheduler byashyizwemo."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Ibyitegererezo ntibyashyizwemo: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Imboni y'ikurikirana"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Ibyagaragaye ntibyashoboye gusomwa. Saba umuyobozi kugenzura inyandiko-mvugo y'umugereka."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Suzuma amatsinda y'impamvu zo gutegereza n'ubushya bw'ishusho y'ako kanya ku ncamake. Ohereza ibirebana n'ibyangombwa byo kwinjira, ihuzwa ry'amahuriro na politiki yo kubungabunga ku muyobozi wa sisitemu."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Izina: koresha kuva ku nyuguti 1 kugeza kuri 64, imibare, utudomo, uturongo tugufi, cyangwa uturongo two munsi, utangirira ku nyuguti cyangwa umubare."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: hitamo imwe muri poller zatanzwe ku rutonde."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Intera y'ikusanya: andika amasegonda yuzuye kuva kuri %d kugeza kuri %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gutwara amakuru: hitamo bumwe mu buryo bwashyizwe ku rutonde."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: andika inzira yuzuye, cyangwa uyireke irimo ubusa kugira ngo hakoreshwe igenamiterere mbanziriza ry'umukusanyamakuru."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: iyi seriveri n'iki cyambu ntibiri ku rutonde rwa host za slurmrestd muri Igenamiterere."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: andika URL ya https:// idafite izina ry'ukoresha, ikibazo (query), cyangwa igice (fragment); http:// isanzwe yemerwa gusa kuri aderesi ya loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Ukoresha slurmrestd: koresha ibimenyetso bitarenze 64 by'inyuguti, imibare, utudomo, uturongo tugufi, cyangwa uturongo two munsi, cyangwa uhareke harimo ubusa kuri token y'ukoresha."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Dosiye ya Token: andika inzira yuzuye ya dosiye ya token ku mukusanyamakuru. Token ubwayo ntiyigera yandikwa hano."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Dosiye ya Token: nta bubiko bwa dosiye za token burashyirwaho. Saba umuyobozi wa Cacti kubishyiraho munsi ya Igenamiterere, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Dosiye ya Token: dosiye igomba kuba iri muri bumwe mu bubiko bwa dosiye za token bwashyizweho muri Igenamiterere (%s)."

