#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Amabwiriza y'umukiriya akoresha porogaramu zashyizweho munsi ya Igenamiterere > HPC Scheduler hamwe n'uburenganzira bwa Slurm bw'ukoresha umukusanyamakuru; inzira ya slurm.conf itari ngombwa ihitamo ihuriro. Ibisabwa bya slurmrestd bikoreshwa gusa n'ubwo buryo bwo gutwara amakuru. Dosiye ya token igomba kuba isomeka n'ukoresha umukusanyamakuru wenyine; umugereka uyisoma muri buri gikorwa kandi ntiwigera ubika token."

