#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "Ingano Ntarenzwa y'Igisubizo ni %d MiB, ariko igisubizo cyasobanuwe gifite iyo ngano ntigikwirwa mu Bubiko bw'Ikusanya bwa %d MiB; umusomyi yemera %d MiB. Ongera Ububiko bw'Ikusanya cyangwa ugabanye Ingano Ntarenzwa y'Igisubizo muri Igenamiterere."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Cyahawe umukusanyamakuru %d, ukusanya amakuru uri kure. Iyi verisiyo ikusanya gusa ku mukusanyamakuru mukuru, bityo ihuriro ntirikusanywa; ikusanya rya kure riteganyijwe mu cyiciro cya 3. Gihereze umukusanyamakuru mukuru."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Intera y'ikusanya iri munsi y'urugero rwo hasi rw'amasegonda %d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Intera y'ikusanya y'amasegonda %d ni ngufi kurusha intera y'umukusanyamakuru y'amasegonda %d; amakuru akusanywa buri masegonda %d."

