#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Umusesenguzi w'amakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Umusesenguzi w'amakuru ya Slurm ku mabwiriza y'umukiriya. Hitamo uwo verisiyo ya buri tsinda risomwa binyuze mu mabwiriza y'umukiriya itanga: v0.0.43 iri muri 25.05, 25.11, na 26.05 kandi ikurwaho muri 27.05; v0.0.44 ikenera 25.11 cyangwa iyisumbuyeho; v0.0.45 ikenera 26.05 cyangwa iyisumbuyeho. Ipaji y'ubuzima irabiburira iyo itsinda ritangaje verisiyo itawufite. Amatsinda asomwa binyuze kuri slurmrestd yirengagiza iri genamiterere: akoresha ugezweho kurusha iyindi muri iyi serivisi itanga, kandi ipaji y'ubuzima yerekana uwo ari wo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Inzira nyakuri igana kuri squeue kuri buri poller isoma itsinda binyuze mu mabwiriza y'umukiriya. Umugereka uyikoresha gusa nka squeue --all --json hamwe n'umusesenguzi w'amakuru uri hejuru."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Inzira nyakuri igana kuri scontrol. Umugereka ukoresha gusa scontrol --json show node, show partition, na show reservation; ntukigera ukoresha update, reconfigure, cyangwa token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Inzira nyakuri igana kuri sshare, ikoreshwa gusa ku matsinda akusanya igabana riringaniye."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Imbibi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo guhamagara"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Amasegonda ihamagara rimwe rya gahunda rishobora gufata mbere y'uko rihagarikwa kandi igice cyaryo kikandikwa ko cyananiwe. Ihamagara kandi ntirirenza igihe cyagenwe cy'umusomyi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa y'igisubizo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "MiB ihamagara rimwe rya gahunda rishobora kugarura. Igisubizo kinini kurushaho kirajugunywa kandi igice cyacyo kikandikwa ko cyananiwe. Gusesengura bisaba hafi inshuro 12 z'ingano y'igisubizo, bityo umusomyi akoresha bitarenze (Ububiko bw'ikusanya - 64) / 12 MiB kandi ipaji y'ubuzima irabiburira iyo iyi mibare ari minini."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ikusanya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "MiB y'ububiko bwa PHP buri gikorwa cy'ikusanya kizamuraho urugero rwacyo (ntirushobora kurumanura). Igenamiterere risanzwe rya 1024 rikwiranye n'ibisubizo bigera kuri 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Inzira nyakuri igana kuri prlimit (util-linux), ikoreshwa mu kugabanya umwanya w'aderesi wa buri bwiriza ry'umukiriya. Siga ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe amabwiriza nta rubibi rw'ububiko; ipaji y'ubuzima izabiburira."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Urubibi rw'ububiko bw'amabwiriza"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "MiB y'umwanya w'aderesi buri bwiriza ry'umukiriya rishobora gukoresha, binyuze kuri prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Ibyangombwa bya slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'amadosiye ya token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Ububiko nyakuri kuri za poller bushobora kubika amadosiye ya token ya slurmrestd, butandukanyijwe n'utumenyetso tw'ikitso cyangwa imyanya. Itsinda rishobora kuvuga gusa dosiye ya token iri muri bumwe muri bwo, ifitwe n'umukoresha wa poller kandi igerwaho nta murongo w'ikimenyetso (symbolic link). Buri bubiko bukwiriye kwemerera gusa root n'umukoresha wa poller kubwandikamo. Ubusa bisobanuye ko nta tsinda rishobora gukoresha slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "Seriveri za slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Bitari ngombwa. Seriveri za slurmrestd itsinda rishobora kuvuga, nka host cyangwa host:port, bitandukanyijwe n'utumenyetso tw'ikitso cyangwa imyanya. Icyanditswe kitagira icyambu cyemera icyambu icyo ari cyo cyose kuri iyo seriveri. Ubusa bwemera seriveri iyo ari yo yose."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Amasegonda mbere y'uko token irangira igihe ipaji y'ubuzima itangira kuburira, niba token ifite igihe cyo kurangiriraho."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Iburira ry'irangira rya token"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Iyo byahiswemo, gukuramo umugereka bigumana amatsinda n'amashusho yawo. Bikureho kugira ngo gukuramo umugereka bibisibe; banza wohereze hanze amatsinda uturutse muri HPC Clusters. Umugereka ntukora ibikoresho bya Cacti cyangwa gahunda za Maint muri iyi verisiyo, kandi gahunda igena imirimo ntijya ivugishwa mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose."

